  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]\n[D]  [A]\n[G]  [D]\n[A/D]  [G]\n[A]\n[A]  [D]\n[D]  [A]\n[G]  [D]\n[A/D]  [G]\n[A]\n[A]  [D]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Fmaj9#11]Run, run,\nrun, run,\n[A9]run, run,\nrun, run\n[D5]Run, run,\nrun, run,\nrun, run,\nrun, run You better\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Em]make your face up in Your\nfavorite disguise With your\n[Fmaj9#11]button down lips and your\nRoller blind eyes With your\n[Em]empty smile And your\nhungry heart Feel the\n[C7M]bile rising from your\nguilty past With your\n[Emadd9/B]nerves in tatters When the cock-\nle shell shatters And the\n[Em]hammers batter\nDown your door You'd better run\n\n[Interlude]\n[D]  [A]\n[G]  [D]\n[A/D]  [G]\n[A]\n[D]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Fmaj9#11]Run, run,\nrun, run,\n[A9]run, run,\nrun, run\n[D5]Run, run,\nrun, run,\nrun, run,\nrun, run You better\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Em]run all day And\nrun all night And\n[Fmaj9#11]keep your dirty feelings\nDeep inside And if you're\n[Em]taking your girlfriend\nOut tonight You'd better\n[Cmaj7]park the car Well\nout of sight 'Cause if they\n[Emadd9/B]catch you in the back seat Trying to\npick her locks They're gonna\n[Em]send you back to mother In a card-\nboard box You better run\n\n[Synth Solo]\n[D5]\n[Em]\n[Fmaj9#11]\n[Em]\n[C7M]\n[Emadd9/B]\n[Em]\n\n[Bridge]\n[D5]\n[Dm]\nYah!\n\n[Outro]\n[D]  [A]\n[G]  [D]\n[A/D]  [G]\n[D]",
